==Important events==
* {{Adv|Red}} finds out that {{Adv|Green}} had stolen his Gym Badges.
* Red disguises as a [[Team Rocket]] grunt and infiltrates their headquarters.
* Team Rocket tries to capture Green as she had stolen their {{p|Mew}} disc.
* Green returns Red's Badges.

